{"author":{"id":"337a442880d7106d509ff84f2f7fef51acce8bce88b081d4f4c3f0298b7e7941"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791776125,"nonce":"l4kjxOipbgsFHZ1h3C1mP+StuJE=","message":"Decision: POST /achievements/seen now waits at most 250 ms for the lock and answers 503 when busy (the notice stays). app.js hides the notice at once on click and keeps it hidden if a racing poll re-renders the same ids, but never detaches the button, because htmx fires the response HX-Trigger on it. inbox.js and tracking.js ignore /achievements/seen like /activity. Reason: a dismiss must not hang behind a pipeline run, and the per-page htmx listeners must not consume a pending selection on a band request.","files":null}]}